<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-8724] Skip logging 3-rd parameter while calling U.warn with initialized logger.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-8724</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;There are a lot of places where exception need to be logged, for example :&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
U.warn(log,&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;Unable to await partitions release &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;future&lt;/span&gt;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;, e);
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;but current U.warn realization silently swallow it.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
    &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;public&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;static&lt;/span&gt; void warn(@Nullable IgniteLogger log, &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;Object&lt;/span&gt; longMsg, &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;Object&lt;/span&gt; shortMsg) {
        &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;assert&lt;/span&gt; longMsg != &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;null&lt;/span&gt;;
        &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;assert&lt;/span&gt; shortMsg != &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;null&lt;/span&gt;;

        &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; (log != &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;null&lt;/span&gt;)
            log.warning(compact(longMsg.toString()));
        &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;else&lt;/span&gt;
            X.println(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;[&quot;&lt;/span&gt; + SHORT_DATE_FMT.format(&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; java.util.Date()) + &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;] (wrn) &quot;&lt;/span&gt; +
                compact(shortMsg.toString()));
    }
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;fix, looks like simple add:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
    &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;public&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;static&lt;/span&gt; void warn(@Nullable IgniteLogger log, &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;Object&lt;/span&gt; longMsg, Throwable ex) {
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
